      },
      "text": "26 December: Puerto Natales – Punta Arenas – Cruise departure"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:2e780f63f4172747",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c5d99b41719c733808df62821c2a2218cf4251d3b7ef9623358877a3da212c68",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261109-mw9omcmv",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to Punta Arenas.\n\nBoard the cruise ship.\n\nA welcome cocktail is served on board, with an opportunity to meet the captain and crew.\n\nThe ship leaves Punta Arenas and sets course for Ushuaia.\n\nThe route takes in the Strait of Magellan, the Beagle Channel and the Whiteside Channel between Darwin Island and Isla Grande de Tierra del Fuego.\n\nOvernight, the ship crosses the Strait of Magellan and enters the fjords of southern Patagonia.\n\nOvernight on board."
    },
